## 🚀 Quickstart & Usage

### Installation
Clone the repository or copy `src/taxEngine.ts` directly into your project:

```bash
git clone [https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/us-paycheck-tax-formulas-2026.git](https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/us-paycheck-tax-formulas-2026.git)
```

### TypeScript Example

```typescript
import { calculatePaycheck, calculateGrossFromNet } from './taxEngine';

// 1. Forward Calculation: $75,000 in Texas (Single)
const result = calculatePaycheck({
  grossSalary: 75000,
  payFrequency: 'biweekly', // 26 pay periods
  filingStatus: 'single',
  state: 'TX'
});

console.log(`Net Bi-Weekly Pay: $${result.netPayPerPeriod.toFixed(2)}`);
console.log(`Federal Tax: $${result.federalTaxAnnual.toFixed(2)}`);
console.log(`FICA Total: $${result.ficaAnnual.toFixed(2)}`);

// 2. Reverse Calculation: Clear $5,000/mo net in Texas
const requiredGross = calculateGrossFromNet(60000, 'TX');
console.log(`Required Annual Gross: $${requiredGross.toFixed(2)}`);
```

